{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ad73702-1a9a-8ad4-ad5a-77fdf05fa83b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T13:17:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, hi, I'm calling about a drain. A catch basin, on the corner. Can you hear me all right? I'm on my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Which corner are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four forty-five Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End. The basin on the corner there is packed solid with leaves. It's been about a week now and the puddle never drains. It just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:13:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so no storm, just a drain that's clogged up and the water's staying put."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say that again, sorry, my hearing's not what it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it's not storm related. It's a clogged drain, and the water's just sitting there. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:14:11-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. It's been dry for days and there's still a pond at the curb. I have to walk around it every morning. Neighbor says it happens every big rain, too. Every time. So nobody's cleaning that thing out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:14:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful to know. Is the water up in the road, or is it just at the curb by the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:14:44-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ma'am, the what? Hold on, I'm walking into the coffee place, it's loud. [pause] They're calling out names over there, the barista's hollering. Okay. The curb, it's at the curb, right over the grate. Spreads out into the street a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me put this in as a clogged catch basin at Van Zandt Avenue, number 445, leaves blocking the grate, standing water. I'll send it to the crew that does drain cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:15:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because this keeps happening and I'm tired of it. I'm not the first one to say something, I'll bet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll note that the neighbors say it floods with every heavy rain, so the crew knows it's a repeat spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. [crosstalk] Sorry, what was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said I'll make a note of that. Do you want a call when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call me. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-oh. And that's Mr. Reardon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Reardon, yes. R-E-A-R-D-O-N. Liam. Now do the crews work on weekends? Because if it's going to sit till Monday I'd like to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not as a regular thing, no. Weekday crews handle most of these. This is on the list now, so I'd expect somebody out there in the next few working days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few working days. Okay. Speak up a little, I missed the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The next few working days. Probably early next week at the latest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early next week. Fine. That's better than nothing. Wait, they're calling a name. That's not mine. Okay, I'll let you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Enjoy your coffee, Mr. Reardon. We'll be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:17:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. Bye now."
    }
  ],
